WEBVTT

00:00.990 --> 00:06.930
Zankoku na tenshi no you ni

00:00.990 --> 00:06.930
Just like the cruel angel

00:06.930 --> 00:14.590
Shounen yo shinwa ni nare

00:06.930 --> 00:14.590
Young boy, become a legend

00:18.990 --> 00:22.410
2D4U PRESENTS:

00:22.770 --> 00:25.810
Aoi kaze ga ima

00:22.770 --> 00:25.810
Even though the untested breeze...

00:25.810 --> 00:29.510
mune no doa o tataitemo

00:25.810 --> 00:29.510
...taps at the door to your heart

00:29.510 --> 00:36.970
Watashi dake o tada mitsumete hohoenderu anata

00:29.510 --> 00:36.970
You just look solely at me and smile

00:37.560 --> 00:44.500
Sotto fureru mono motomeru koto ni muchuu de

00:37.560 --> 00:44.500
So intent on seeking out that gentle touch

00:44.500 --> 00:51.400
Unmei sae mada shiranai itaike na hitomi

00:44.500 --> 00:51.400
Such innocent eyes, still ignorant of their destiny

00:52.000 --> 00:55.750
Dakedo itsuka kizuku deshou

00:52.000 --> 00:55.750
But someday, you are sure to realize...

00:55.750 --> 00:58.340
sono senaka ni wa

00:55.750 --> 00:58.340
...that upon your back

00:59.510 --> 01:02.960
Haruka mirai mezasu tame

00:59.510 --> 01:02.960
You have the wings with which to fly...

01:02.960 --> 01:06.310
no hane ga aru koto

01:02.960 --> 01:06.310
...towards the distant future

01:06.990 --> 01:10.690
Zankoku na tenshi no teeze

01:06.990 --> 01:10.690
The cruel angel's thesis

01:10.690 --> 01:14.430
Madobe kara yagate tobidatsu

01:10.690 --> 01:14.430
Soon, you will take flight from the windowsill

01:14.430 --> 01:18.200
Hotobashiru atsui patosu de

01:14.430 --> 01:18.200
With your torrent of ardent pathos

01:18.200 --> 01:21.900
Omoide o uragiru nara

01:18.200 --> 01:21.900
If you are to betray our memories

01:21.900 --> 01:25.540
Kono sora o daite kagayaku

01:21.900 --> 01:25.540
You, who embrace these heavens and shine

01:25.540 --> 01:29.270
Shounen yo shinwa ni nare

01:25.540 --> 01:29.270
Young boy, become a legend

01:31.360 --> 01:33.110
Hey, have you seen her yet?

01:33.110 --> 01:34.190
Oh, yeah! Yeah!

01:34.190 --> 01:35.240
Seen who?

01:35.240 --> 01:37.400
You dork, you haven't seen
the foreign girl yet?

01:37.400 --> 01:38.530
Foreign girl?

01:38.530 --> 01:40.660
Yeah, she's in 8th grade, Class A.

01:40.660 --> 01:43.790
She just transferred here last week.

01:44.500 --> 01:46.460
She's hot!

01:47.410 --> 01:50.210
Great Deal
30 yen per picture

01:47.410 --> 01:50.210
Asuka Langley Sohryu
Photo Order Sheet

01:47.670 --> 01:50.750
Her name's Asuka Langley Sohryu,
did you know that?

01:50.750 --> 01:53.250
She's seriously cute.

01:53.250 --> 01:55.090
Since she was raised over there
but born here,

01:55.090 --> 01:56.840
do you think she matured early?

01:56.840 --> 01:58.380
Don't be stupid!

01:58.380 --> 02:00.850
I bet she broke up in Germany,
and she's here in a foreign land

02:00.850 --> 02:04.100
with a heart that can't be mended.

02:03.720 --> 02:05.930
To Miss Sohryu

02:07.810 --> 02:09.980
Oh, man...

02:09.980 --> 02:12.480
Everybody and their brother!

02:12.480 --> 02:15.400
Asuka! Asuka!

02:15.400 --> 02:16.650
They're just ignorant.

02:16.650 --> 02:18.570
Thank you, come again.

02:19.280 --> 02:23.030
At least the pictures don't
reveal her personality.

02:23.490 --> 02:25.290
Hello!

02:25.290 --> 02:26.660
Shinji!

02:26.660 --> 02:28.330
Guten Morgen!

02:28.330 --> 02:30.170
Guten morgen...

02:30.170 --> 02:35.420
Hey, why so gloomy this early?
This is the gorgeous Asuka greeting you!

02:35.420 --> 02:38.260
Look a little more happy about it!

02:38.760 --> 02:42.050
So the other one's here too, isn't she?

02:42.050 --> 02:43.050
Who's that?

02:43.050 --> 02:46.890
What are you, stupid? I'm talking about
the First Child, of course!

02:46.890 --> 02:48.850
Oh, if it's Ayanami...

02:58.690 --> 03:00.610
Hello!

03:00.610 --> 03:04.070
You must be Rei Ayanami,
the pilot of the prototype.

03:06.290 --> 03:09.370
I'm Asuka! Asuka Langley Sohryu.

03:09.370 --> 03:13.000
I'm the pilot of Eva Unit 02.
Let's be good friends!

03:13.000 --> 03:14.080
Why?

03:14.080 --> 03:17.800
Because it'd be convenient, in lots of ways.

03:17.800 --> 03:20.170
If I'm ordered to, I will.

03:20.170 --> 03:21.630
Talk about odd.

03:21.630 --> 03:25.720
I'll say. Are only weirdos chosen
to be pilots?

03:35.610 --> 03:37.070
Have you lost some weight?

03:37.070 --> 03:38.190
Have I?

03:38.190 --> 03:40.110
You must be enduring an unrequited love.

03:40.110 --> 03:43.360
How did you know?

03:45.320 --> 03:46.450
Because...

03:46.450 --> 03:48.990
"A woman with a mole in
the pathway of her tears

03:48.990 --> 03:51.540
is destined to a life full of them."

03:51.540 --> 03:54.540
If you're trying to put a move on me,
I'm afraid you can't.

03:54.540 --> 03:56.880
There's a very scary lady watching us.

04:00.800 --> 04:02.760
Long time no see, Kaji.

04:02.760 --> 04:04.430
It's been a while.

04:04.430 --> 04:07.470
You're actually pretty careless,
aren't you, Kaji?

04:07.470 --> 04:09.890
He's as much of an idiot as ever.

04:09.890 --> 04:13.730
If you're done handing over Unit 02,
hurry up and leave!

04:13.730 --> 04:17.610
I just received orders this morning
that I'll be staying here on loan.

04:17.610 --> 04:20.940
So the three of us can hang out again,
just like we used to.

04:20.940 --> 04:22.860
Who'd hang out with YOU?

04:23.820 --> 04:25.660
Enemy attack?!

04:25.660 --> 04:28.330
We just got this report from the
patrolling battlecruiser Haruna.

04:28.330 --> 04:32.250
"Huge submerged object detected off
Ki'i peninsula. Sending data."

04:32.580 --> 04:34.790
The data has been collated.

04:34.790 --> 04:37.080
Wavelength pattern Blue.
Confirmed to be an Angel.

04:37.080 --> 04:39.210
All personnel, go to
battle stations, Level One.

04:39.250 --> 04:42.720
EPISODE 09
MOMENT AND
HEART TOGETHER

04:44.510 --> 04:50.100
The recent battle severely damaged
the intercept system of New Tokyo-3.

04:50.100 --> 04:53.180
We've only effected 26 percent
of the repairs at present.

04:53.180 --> 04:56.190
And our operational capability for
actual combat is virtually nil.

04:56.560 --> 04:59.980
Therefore, we'll crush the target
in a single blow

04:59.980 --> 05:02.070
at the water's edge, right
before it makes landfall!

05:02.070 --> 05:06.110
Units 01 and 02 will mount an attack
in a series of waves.

05:06.110 --> 05:07.490
In other words, close in and take turns.

05:07.490 --> 05:08.660
Roger.

05:08.660 --> 05:11.910
This sucks. It's my Japanese debut.

05:11.910 --> 05:14.580
Why won't she let me take it out myself?

05:15.210 --> 05:18.040
It can't be helped. That's the strategy.

05:18.040 --> 05:22.460
Let me tell you something,
just don't get in my way!

05:24.050 --> 05:26.590
Why did someone like him get chosen
to be a pilot?

05:39.810 --> 05:43.440
Two against one isn't a fair fight.
I don't like it. Not my style.

05:44.280 --> 05:49.160
We don't have the luxury of choosing
our means to survive.

05:52.530 --> 05:53.120
Here it comes!

05:59.710 --> 06:01.540
Commence attack!

06:01.540 --> 06:04.050
Okay, I'll go first! Back me up!

06:04.050 --> 06:05.380
Back you up?

06:05.380 --> 06:06.760
Ladies first!

06:06.760 --> 06:09.720
Sheesh, don't order me around!
You're the new one!

06:14.850 --> 06:15.430
I can take him!

06:29.610 --> 06:30.360
Amazing!

06:33.280 --> 06:35.740
Well, Third Child?!

06:35.740 --> 06:38.290
A fight should be elegant and without waste.

06:50.630 --> 06:52.510
That's cheating!

06:57.930 --> 07:01.020
Today, at 10:58:15 AM,

07:01.020 --> 07:04.570
Unit 01 was attacked by Target A,

07:04.570 --> 07:07.730
which split from the target
submerged 2 km off Suruga Bay.

07:07.730 --> 07:12.110
At the same time, plus 20 seconds,
Unit 02 was halted by Target B.

07:12.110 --> 07:15.280
We have a comment from
the chair of Project E.

07:15.280 --> 07:16.450
This is pathetic.

07:16.450 --> 07:20.620
This is all your fault! You totally
screwed up my debut battle!

07:20.620 --> 07:21.960
What are you talking about?

07:21.960 --> 07:24.590
You're the one who did something stupid!

07:24.590 --> 07:28.130
Stupid?! Where does a lamebrain like you
get off calling me that?

07:28.130 --> 07:29.590
That's just shameless!

07:29.590 --> 07:33.140
What do you mean?! We got in this trouble
because you were in such a rush to defeat it!

07:33.140 --> 07:36.600
What was that? You look like a drowned rat!
How lame!

07:34.550 --> 07:38.810
At 11:03 AM, NERV abandoned the operation

07:36.600 --> 07:39.640
Like you can talk!

07:39.640 --> 07:42.770
And transferred command to
the UN Secondary Force.

07:42.770 --> 07:45.310
You've humiliated us.

07:45.310 --> 07:48.940
At 11:05 AM, the UN forces made
an attack with an N2 mine.

07:49.530 --> 07:52.450
We'll have to re-draw the map again.

07:52.490 --> 07:55.120
7th Angel A/B

07:52.490 --> 07:55.990
They succeeded in burning off 28%
of the target's structural substance.

07:55.200 --> 07:55.990
Did they kill it?

07:55.240 --> 07:58.950
7th Angel B

07:55.240 --> 07:58.950
7th Angel A

07:55.240 --> 07:58.950
Report:
Department of Investigation Division 2,
Nerv Scientific Investigation Branch

07:55.990 --> 07:59.500
This is merely temporary relief.
A second attack is a matter of time.

07:59.500 --> 08:03.500
At least it bought us time to regroup,
so we got something out of it.

08:03.500 --> 08:05.500
Listen up, you two.

08:05.500 --> 08:08.090
Do you know what your job is?

08:08.090 --> 08:09.210
Piloting Eva.

08:09.210 --> 08:11.510
No! Your job is to defeat the Angels.

08:11.510 --> 08:15.590
Nerv does not exist to make
grotesque displays like this.

08:15.590 --> 08:17.850
Therefore, you two must cooperate.

08:17.850 --> 08:19.720
Why should we?!

08:19.720 --> 08:21.310
Enough already.

08:23.350 --> 08:25.850
Why's everyone so touchy here?

08:25.850 --> 08:28.440
It's because adults don't like
to be embarrassed.

08:28.440 --> 08:31.030
Where's Miss Misato?

08:31.030 --> 08:35.110
Cleaning things up. The person in charge
exists to take responsibility.

08:36.450 --> 08:39.700
Here are the internal protests
and damage reports,

08:39.700 --> 08:42.500
and this is a bill from the UN,

08:42.500 --> 08:44.750
and here you have complaints from
the PR department as well.

08:45.370 --> 08:47.170
Make sure you read them all.

08:47.170 --> 08:49.590
I don't have to read them
to know what they say.

08:49.590 --> 08:52.210
"If you're going to fight, do it here," right?

08:52.210 --> 08:53.550
How insightful.

08:53.550 --> 08:57.010
I don't need them to tell me. I'll do it here
as soon as the topside gets cleaned up.

08:57.390 --> 09:00.220
I'll destroy the Angels without fail.

09:00.220 --> 09:02.350
The Vice Commander is livid.

09:02.350 --> 09:06.190
You'll almost certainly be demoted
if you embarrass him again.

09:06.190 --> 09:09.820
It was a silver lining that
Commander Ikari wasn't here.

09:09.820 --> 09:13.360
If he'd been here, you'd have been fired
before he ever saw these.

09:13.360 --> 09:17.110
So, you brought me an idea
to help save my job, right?

09:17.450 --> 09:19.240
Just one.

09:19.240 --> 09:21.330
You're amazing, Dr. Ritsuko Akagi.

09:21.330 --> 09:24.160
It's good to have kind friends from way back.

09:24.160 --> 09:28.290
Unfortunately, I'm not the one who will be
bailing out my old friend.

09:28.290 --> 09:30.500
This is Kaji's idea.

09:28.580 --> 09:30.000
To my honey

09:30.500 --> 09:32.090
Kaji's?

09:45.480 --> 09:51.360
I'm home! Not that anyone's here,
of course, but...

09:53.150 --> 09:54.440
What is this?!

09:54.440 --> 09:56.030
Don't be so rude!

09:56.030 --> 09:57.990
Those are my personal belongings!

09:57.990 --> 10:00.320
What are you doing here?!

10:01.530 --> 10:03.160
It's more like, why are you still here?

10:03.160 --> 10:04.620
Still here?

10:05.620 --> 10:07.540
You've been dumped for the new model!

10:09.120 --> 10:11.460
Misato will be living with me.

10:11.460 --> 10:15.630
Well, it's the logical choice when you
consider whose abilities are superior.

10:15.630 --> 10:18.090
Although honestly, I'd rather live with Mr. Kaji.

10:18.090 --> 10:21.760
But why are Japanese rooms
so small anyway?

10:22.050 --> 10:24.560
Not even half of my stuff fits!

10:25.100 --> 10:27.020
Shin's Ro

10:27.230 --> 10:31.900
On top of which, why don't the Japanese
have any sense of privacy?

10:31.900 --> 10:35.650
How can they live in rooms without locks?
Unbelievable!

10:35.650 --> 10:37.150
It's because the Japanese way

10:37.150 --> 10:39.490
is to consider the priorities and needs
of others before one's own.

10:39.490 --> 10:40.570
Miss Misato!

10:40.570 --> 10:43.950
Welcome home! Looks like you're
getting along well already.

10:43.950 --> 10:45.200
What do you mean?

10:45.200 --> 10:47.120
This is all preparation for the next operation.

10:47.120 --> 10:48.460
How's that?

10:49.040 --> 10:51.540
The seventh Angel has one
and only one weakness!

10:51.540 --> 10:55.250
A simultaneous two-point attack
on each target's core

10:55.250 --> 10:56.090
while its components are separated.

10:57.210 --> 11:01.720
In other words, an attack by two Evas
with perfectly synchronized timing.

11:02.090 --> 11:06.430
For that, we'll need cooperation and
perfect coordination from you two.

11:06.640 --> 11:10.730
Therefore, I'm having you two live together.

11:12.900 --> 11:13.860
No way!

11:13.860 --> 11:16.860
It's always been said that boys and girls
shouldn't sleep together after age seven!

11:16.860 --> 11:19.190
The Angel is currently restoring itself.

11:19.190 --> 11:21.490
It will begin its second assault in six days,
so there's no time.

11:21.490 --> 11:23.820
But that's crazy!

11:24.570 --> 11:27.580
So here's how to make the crazy possible.

11:27.580 --> 11:30.330
In order for you to master perfect unison,

11:30.330 --> 11:32.830
you'll memorize the attack pattern that's been
arranged to this music.

11:33.210 --> 11:36.040
In six days, as soon as possible.

11:47.010 --> 11:49.770
But I wonder what's happened to Shinji.

11:49.770 --> 11:52.100
He's been gone three days, right?

11:55.810 --> 11:57.190
Hey, there's the class rep.

11:57.190 --> 11:58.780
Two of the three stooges.

11:58.780 --> 12:01.110
Why are you here?

12:01.110 --> 12:04.410
To see how Miss Sohryu is doing.
What about you two?

12:04.410 --> 12:06.740
To see how Ikari's doing.

12:06.740 --> 12:08.660
Why did you stop here?

12:11.330 --> 12:13.120
Yes?

12:15.920 --> 12:19.170
Traitor!

12:19.170 --> 12:21.670
Matching outfits yet again,
in this day and age?!

12:21.670 --> 12:23.880
I can't believe this!

12:23.880 --> 12:29.430
Well, Miss Misato said that Japanese start by
dressing the part, so she made us...

12:30.560 --> 12:32.600
That's filthy, you two!

12:32.600 --> 12:34.440
You're wrong! You're wrong!

12:34.440 --> 12:36.060
Two wrongs don't make a right!

12:36.060 --> 12:37.650
Oh, welcome everybody!

12:39.070 --> 12:41.490
Could ya please explain
what all this's about?

12:43.400 --> 12:46.530
You shoulda told us that to begin with.

12:46.530 --> 12:49.200
So how is the coordination coming?

12:49.200 --> 12:51.450
Well, as you can see...

12:55.790 --> 12:57.330
Are you surprised?!

12:57.330 --> 13:01.210
There's no way I could possibly lower myself
to Shinji's level!

13:01.210 --> 13:03.550
It's just an utterly impossible idea!

13:03.550 --> 13:05.970
Then you give up?

13:05.970 --> 13:07.840
You don't have anyone else, do you?

13:09.050 --> 13:10.100
Rei?

13:10.100 --> 13:10.720
Yes, Ma'am.

13:10.720 --> 13:11.890
Why don't you try?

13:11.890 --> 13:13.140
Yes, Ma'am.

13:24.030 --> 13:27.610
It looks like I should alter the
operation to pair Shinji and Rei.

13:32.870 --> 13:35.660
No! I can't stand this! I've had enough!

13:39.290 --> 13:39.790
Asuka!

13:39.790 --> 13:41.960
Even the Devil cries sometimes.

13:41.960 --> 13:45.220
Ikari!

13:47.380 --> 13:49.050
Go after her!

13:49.590 --> 13:52.970
You made a girl cry! Take responsibility!

14:01.440 --> 14:02.020
Well...

14:02.020 --> 14:03.610
Don't say anything.

14:08.030 --> 14:09.610
I know.

14:09.610 --> 14:11.780
I have no choice but to pilot the Eva.

14:14.660 --> 14:16.370
I'll do it.

14:17.710 --> 14:21.630
Since it's come to this, I'll show up
both Rei and Misato!

14:21.630 --> 14:23.880
You don't have to show them up or anything.

14:23.880 --> 14:27.340
You're being too easy on them!
You're a man, aren't you?!

14:27.510 --> 14:29.680
For their attack...

14:29.680 --> 14:31.140
on my pride...

14:31.140 --> 14:33.930
I'll pay them back ten times over!

14:45.110 --> 14:45.860
TWO
MORE
DAYS

15:06.250 --> 15:09.380
ATTACK
TOMORROW

15:14.350 --> 15:15.430
Where's Misato?

15:15.430 --> 15:18.890
At work. She called earlier.
She'll be there all night.

15:19.390 --> 15:22.270
So that means we're all alone tonight.

15:34.950 --> 15:38.200
This is the impenetrable Wall of Jericho.

15:39.620 --> 15:42.620
Take one step over this wall
and you're a dead man.

15:42.620 --> 15:45.130
And now, it's time for children to go to bed!

15:46.710 --> 15:50.880
How can the Japanese sleep on the floor?
I can't believe it.

16:58.410 --> 17:00.120
Mama...

17:01.290 --> 17:03.000
Mama...

17:13.050 --> 17:15.340
You're just a child yourself.

17:16.510 --> 17:18.220
No, somebody will see us.

17:18.220 --> 17:18.850
Who's watching?

17:18.850 --> 17:20.430
Someb...

17:42.040 --> 17:44.910
Honestly! There's nothing
between us anymore.

17:44.910 --> 17:46.540
Don't do that again.

17:46.540 --> 17:49.630
But your lips didn't say no.

17:51.040 --> 17:53.920
Your lips or your words...

17:53.920 --> 17:56.010
Which one should I trust?

18:17.240 --> 18:19.110
There you go.

18:19.110 --> 18:20.530
Thanks.

18:20.530 --> 18:22.370
You're unusually sober today.

18:22.370 --> 18:24.870
Yeah, a little.

18:24.870 --> 18:27.580
Work? Or a man?

18:27.870 --> 18:29.540
A lot of things.

18:30.710 --> 18:32.750
Still in love?

18:33.550 --> 18:35.630
Don't say weird stuff like that!

18:35.630 --> 18:37.550
Who'd want that jerk?!

18:38.970 --> 18:41.260
It may have been a youthful indiscretion,

18:41.260 --> 18:45.270
but I can't believe I was dating a jerk like him.
It's the biggest blemish on my life.

18:45.720 --> 18:49.640
I meant that he may still like you.
Did I scare you?

18:49.640 --> 18:50.980
Why you lousy...

18:50.980 --> 18:52.810
Getting angry only shows I hit a sore spot.

18:53.820 --> 18:56.480
Why not be more honest with
your feelings this time?

18:56.480 --> 18:58.740
Things are different than eight years ago.

18:58.740 --> 19:02.490
It hasn't changed. Not a bit.
Still too immature.

19:03.410 --> 19:08.330
Well, I've got to get to work.
Tomorrow is the big day.

19:19.340 --> 19:22.680
Target has broken through
the final defense line at Gora.

19:22.680 --> 19:24.350
Here it comes!

19:24.350 --> 19:26.310
We won't fail this time!

19:26.310 --> 19:29.390
Deploy your AT fields as soon
as the music starts.

19:29.390 --> 19:30.890
Then stick to the operation.

19:30.890 --> 19:32.810
Got it, you two?

19:32.810 --> 19:34.360
Roger!

19:34.360 --> 19:36.570
The target has entered the mountains.

19:36.570 --> 19:40.320
Full power, maximum speed
from the start, got it?

19:40.320 --> 19:43.490
I know that. We'll finish in sixty-two seconds.

19:43.490 --> 19:46.120
Target entering Ground Zero.

19:46.120 --> 19:47.620
Detach external power cables.

19:49.620 --> 19:50.330
Launch.

19:51.080 --> 19:53.370
Time remaining

21:03.320 --> 21:05.150
Both Evas confirmed operational.

21:07.780 --> 21:09.700
Geez...

21:09.700 --> 21:10.450
This is pathetic.

21:15.370 --> 21:18.750
You jerk! How dare you do that
to my Unit 02?!

21:18.750 --> 21:21.670
What are you talking about?
You're the one who fell on me!

21:21.670 --> 21:24.800
You're the one who lost his timing first!

21:24.800 --> 21:26.800
It's because you're always so out of it!

21:26.800 --> 21:29.260
What were you doing, staying up
so late last night?!

21:29.260 --> 21:32.680
Image training for today's battle!

21:32.680 --> 21:36.390
Liar! I know you tried to kiss me
while I was sleeping!

21:36.390 --> 21:38.940
No fair! You were awake?!

21:38.940 --> 21:43.530
That's awful! I was just kidding,
but it was real?! You kissed me?!

21:43.530 --> 21:46.070
No, I didn't! I stopped!

21:46.070 --> 21:48.450
Pervert! Lech! Fiend! I can't believe you!

21:48.450 --> 21:53.290
It's because you talk in your sleep
and toss and turn so much!

21:54.540 --> 21:56.830
Those kids are embarrassing us again.

21:56.870 --> 21:59.830
TO BE CONTINUED

23:05.270 --> 23:06.110
PREVIEW

23:06.320 --> 23:09.240
The crater of Mount Asama where
an unhatched Angel lies.

23:09.240 --> 23:11.700
Nerv attempts the first capture of an Angel.

23:11.700 --> 23:15.120
A specially-equipped Eva Unit 02
challenges the fires of Hell!

23:15.120 --> 23:17.410
Next episode: "Magma Diver"

23:17.410 --> 23:18.870
And I'll give you more fan service next time!

23:17.660 --> 23:20.290
Magma Diver
